{{ errorBanner({ message: "…" }) }}{% endraw %}{% endset %}
  {{ usage(code) }}
  <p><strong>Used on:</strong> Product pages, /cart/</p>
  <p><code>&lt;error-banner&gt;</code> listens to the cart store. It shows the store’s message on an error and hides again after the next successful change. It uses <code>role="alert"</code>, so it’s read out straight away.</p>
</section>

